WEBVTT

00:33:57.228 --> 00:34:01.449
(Music)

00:34:03.074 --> 00:34:05.736
In some ways, Lynda was primed
for this kind of crap ...

00:34:05.760 --> 00:34:07.728
Excuse me. (Laughs)

00:34:07.752 --> 00:34:10.385
In some ways, Lynda was primed
for this kind of crap ...

00:34:10.409 --> 00:34:13.042
(Laughs) It's not crappy, it's scrappy.

00:34:14.493 --> 00:34:17.304
In some ways, Lynda was primed
for this kind of crappy ...

00:34:17.328 --> 00:34:19.995
(Laughs)

00:34:21.373 --> 00:34:22.524
Sorry.

00:34:22.548 --> 00:34:24.421
(Laughs)